1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
My golden Bangla, I love you

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Forever your skies be, your air like a flute set my heart in tune

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
My golden Bangla, I love you

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:01:03,000
O Mother, aroma of mango orchard in "Falgun" driveth me crazy,
Ah, such miraculousness!
O Mother, time seeth in "Ogrohayon" smiles sweet all through fields of paddy.

5
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,000
My golden Bangla, I love you.

6
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:27,000
What a beauty, what a shades, what an affection, what a tenderness;
What a quilt thou hast spread at tip of banyans 'long every bank,

7
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:49,000
O Mother, words from your lips like nectar to my ears.
Ah, such miraculousness!

8
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:01,000
If sadness, o mother, cast a gloom on thy face, my eyes filled with tears.

9
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:14,000
My golden Bangla, I love you.